contribution small_academy(small_academy) v1
description "An academy that yields ten learning a season. With every other building once, the buildings add 13 at most, inside the 40 the sum takes"
to "../province_learning.rule" signature:19c9f59d718a2f26

extend building with academy

clause academy_learning -> learning_add
  when building academy
  then 10
  overrides learning_of

sequence every_building
| building |
| temple   |
| library  |
| market   |
| academy  |

examples
| buildings      | -> learning |
| every_building | 14          |
